I reach the large clothing store in town.
It is very crowded here.
I slowly enter the store.
It is very cold inside the store.
There is air conditioning there.
I feel a great relief.
Because of the rain, it is very humid outside.
This cold is better than the humidity outside.
There are a lot of items in the store.
I look around.
First, I need a raincoat.
I walk past the women's clothing section.
I don't see any raincoats there.
I see a worker there.
I ask him.
"Where is the raincoat section?"
He points to the right side.
I walk over there.
